      "problem": "Find the real solution to the equation ${x}^{3}=-343.$",
      "worked_solution": "We can solve this equation by taking the $3$rd root of each side and solving for $x.$ Since $n=3$ is odd, there is only one real solution to this equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3} & =-343 \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{x}^{3}} & =\\sqrt[3]{-343} \\\\ x & =\\sqrt[3]{(-7)^{3}} \\\\ x & =-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-7.$",
